repository-code: "https://github.com/RemiPelloux/Modelly"
url: "https://remipelloux.github.io/Modelly/"
abstract: >-
  Modelly is an agent-based modeling (ABM) framework for Python. A model is a typed
  scenario, agent classes with a step, and a model that owns the world and its seed.
  Agent attributes can live in numpy arrays, spaces include grids, networks and
  continuous space, time is discrete ticks or scheduled events, and every dataset
  lands in pandas.
keywords:
- agent-based modeling
- agent-based simulation
